**/*.pyc
/build*/
# Ghidra: what is one person's, or one session's, rather than the project's.
# The programs and their analysis (<project>.rep/idata, project.prp, the .gpr)
# are shared; the lock while a project is open, scratch files, the window
# layout and per-user data (bookmarks, view state) are not. Ghidra recreates
# what is missing when the project is opened.
*.lock
*.lock~
**/*.rep/idata/**/*.ps
**/*.rep/projectState
**/*.rep/user/
